  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/ironjetpacks?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/cucumber_required.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"84\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/downloads&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252firon-jetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/ironjetpacks/mc_version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fironjetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fironjetpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Iron Jetpacks 是一款現代化的噴射背包模組，功能豐富且易用。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>功能特色</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全可自訂！所有噴射背包的數值與屬性皆可設定，甚至能新增自訂項目！<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fironjetpacks%252fjetpack-json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">（文件）</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">內建一系列預設噴射背包，採用多種原版與模組素材製作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用 Forge Energy (FE) 供電，提供廣泛的模組相容性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">油門控制！即時調整空中移動速度！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過內建 HUD 查看目前的能量、引擎、懸浮與油門狀態。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>全新！</strong>支援 Curios！可將噴射背包作為 Curios 飾品裝備。</span></li>\n</ul>",
